desc:ReaProof Serialize BROKEN (unstable payload)
// Deliberately-broken variant for catalog item 3: the serialize payload
// includes a value that changes on EVERY serialize pass, which is exactly
// what a shared-scratch @serialize/audio-thread race produces - two saves of
// an unchanged project store different bytes. The battery saves twice and
// byte-diffs the <JS_SER> payload; any diff is a red.

slider1:0<-24,24,0.01>Gain (dB)

in_pin:left input
in_pin:right input
out_pin:left output
out_pin:right output

@init
sn = 0;

@slider
gain = 10^(slider1/20);

@sample
spl0 *= gain;
spl1 *= gain;

@serialize
sn += 1;
file_var(0, sn);
